## SECTION=project_specific

config XXRI_BASE
	bool
	prompt "xxri-base: XXRI's configuration, scripts, theme and artwork"
	help
	  Everything XXRI adds to or changes in Tiny Core that is not a
	  program: boot and session scripts (tc-config -> xxri-config, the
	  xxri-pkg tools), /etc files, the desktop session, the XXRI GTK and
	  cursor themes, icons, fonts and wallpaper.  Source: projectroot/.
